<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>New Login Alert</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f4f4f4; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .container { max-width: 560px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.1); }
    .header { background: #e67e22; padding: 24px 32px; }
    .header h1 { color: #fff; margin: 0; font-size: 22px; }
    .body { padding: 32px; color: #333; }
    .detail { background: #fdf6ec; border-left: 4px solid #e67e22; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 4px; margin: 16px 0; }
    .detail p { margin: 4px 0; font-size: 14px; }
    .detail strong { display: inline-block; width: 80px; color: #555; }
    .footer { padding: 16px 32px; background: #f9f9f9; color: #888; font-size: 12px; text-align: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header"><h1>SentinelAuth — New Login Detected</h1></div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
      <p>We detected a new login to your account. If this was you, no action is needed.</p>
      <div class="detail">
        <p><strong>Device:</strong> {{device}}</p>
        <p><strong>Location:</strong> {{location}}</p>
        <p><strong>IP:</strong> {{ip}}</p>
        <p><strong>Time:</strong> {{time}}</p>
      </div>
      <p>If you don't recognize this login, please change your password immediately.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">© SentinelAuth. Do not reply to this email.</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
